  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Ri1IxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"577\" height=\"319\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>新增珍珠奶茶與咖啡等飲品，可搭配 Create 模組的機器進行製作。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">超過 40 種口味支援自動化！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ltNTbl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"603\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M2UUrec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"237\"></p>\n<p><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AWuqkC9Xmx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/006/892/625/original/discord-logo-icon-editorial-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Discord Logo Icon editorial vector 6892625 Vector Art at Vecteezy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/dev_myst\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/002/534/045/original/social-media-twitter-logo-blue-isolated-free-vector.jpg\" alt=\"Twitter Bird Icon Vector Art, Icons, and Graphics for Free Download\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">必備模組：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多口味擴充：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-trees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pams Harvestcraft 2 Trees</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-crops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Crops</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Croptopia</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atmospheric</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmental\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Autumnity</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neapolitan </a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他推薦食物模組：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seasonals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Seasonals（需搭配 Atmospheric 和 Autumnity）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/peculiars\" rel=\"nofollow\">Peculiars（需搭配 Atmospheric）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Food Core</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pams-harvestcraft-2-food-extended\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pam's Harvestcraft 2 Extended（需搭配 Pam's Trees 與 Crops）</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">若有建議或回報問題，請前往 GitHub 的 Issues 頁面。</span></strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\">可在本頁第 4 個分頁「Issues」中找到。</span></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：1.16 版本已停止支援，未來可能不會推出太多更新。</span></p>",
